  "faq": {
    "title": "Questions & answers",
    "items": [
      {
        "q": "Do you cater on yachts?",
        "a": "Yes, yachts are one of our main venues. Tell us the yacht, marina and number of guests — we will plan everything for it."
      },
      {
        "q": "How much does catering cost?",
        "a": "Every event is calculated individually: it depends on the number of guests, menu, staff and format. Ready-made packages are a good starting point."
      },
      {
        "q": "Can you help with decor, furniture or a DJ?",
        "a": "Yes. We can organise furniture, tableware, decor, flowers, a photographer, a DJ and more — on our own or with trusted partners."
      },
      {
        "q": "Can the menu be adjusted?",
        "a": "Of course. Packages are a starting point; we adjust the menu to your guests, preferences and dietary needs."
      },
      {
        "q": "How do I place an order?",
        "a": "Leave a request on the website or message us on WhatsApp with the date, venue and number of guests. We will reply with a proposal."
      }
    ]
  },
